  "interactiveSurface": "Every slider's interactive surface is its whole box - interactiveWidth by interactiveHeight - while the drawn track is trackThickness across. The two differ on purpose: a reader that made only the drawn track draggable would reproduce the picture and ship a control no thumb can hit.",
